    label "W57CrMHaqDU"
    step 0
    date "2021-01-11T19:44:11Z"
    title "Lana Del Rey - Chemtrails Over The Country Club (Lyrics)"
    description "Lana Del Rey - Chemtrails Over The Country Club (Lyrics) is a lyric video for &#34;Chemtrails Over The Country Club&#34; by Lana Del Rey. Title track from Lana&#8217;s upcoming seventh studio album. Del Rey first mentioned the song and record on May 25th, 2020 via Instagram.&#10;&#10;On September 1st, Del Rey teased she was filming the music video for the song via Instagram.&#10;&#10;Later on December 22, Lana announced the single to be released on January 11th alongside its music video and the preorder of the record via Instragram.&#10;&#10;You can stream Lana Del Rey - Chemtrails Over The Country Club here: https://lana.lnk.to/ChemtrailsOverTheCountryClubVD&#10;&#10;Below are links to Lana Del Rey's official social media:&#10;&#10;Lana Del Rey Instagram: http://www.instagram.com/lanadelrey&#10;Lana Del Rey Facebook: http://www.facebook.com/lanadelrey&#10;Lana Del Rey Twitter: http://www.twitter.com/lanadelrey&#10;Lana Del Rey Tumblr: http://lanadelrey.tumblr.com&#10;&#10;Lana Del Rey - Chemtrails Over The Country Club (Lyrics)&#10;&#10;[Lana Del Rey]&#10;I'm on the run with you, my sweet love&#10;There's nothing wrong contemplating God&#10;Under the chemtrails&#8197;over&#8197;the country club&#10;Wearing&#8197;our jewels in the swimming pool&#10;Me&#8197;and my sister just playing it cool&#10;Under the chemtrails over&#8287;the&#8287;country&#8287;club&#10;&#10;[Lana Del Rey]&#10;Take out your&#8287;turquoise and all&#8287;of your jewels&#10;Go to the market, the kids' swimming pools&#10;Baby, what's your sign?&#10;My moon's in Leo, my Cancer is sun&#10;You won't play, you're no fun&#10;Well I don't care what they think&#10;Drag racing my little red sports car&#10;I'm not unhinged or unhappy, I'm just wild&#10;&#10;[Lana Del Rey]&#10;I'm on the run with you, my sweet love&#10;There's nothing wrong contemplating God&#10;Under the chemtrails over the country club&#10;Wearing our jewels in the swimming pool&#10;Me and my sister just playing it cool&#10;Under the chemtrails over the country club&#10;&#10;[Lana Del Rey]&#10;Meet you for coffee&#10;At the elementary schools&#10;We'll laugh about nothing&#10;As the summer gets cool&#10;It's beautiful, I'll escape&#10;Normality settles down over me&#10;I'm not bored or unhappy&#10;I'm still so strange and wild&#10;&#10;[Lana Del Rey]&#10;I'm in the wind, I'm in the water&#10;Nobody's son, nobody's daughter&#10;Watching the chemtrails over the country club&#10;Suburbia, The Brentwood Market&#10;What to do next? Maybe we'll love it&#10;White picket, chemtrails over the country club&#10;&#10;[Lana Del Rey]&#10;My love, my love&#10;Washing my hair, doing my laundry&#10;Late night to be, I want you holding me&#10;Like when we were kids&#10;Under chemtrails and country clubs&#10;&#10;[Lana Del Rey]&#10;It's never too late, baby, so don't give up&#10;It's never too late, baby, so don't give up&#10;Under the chemtrails over the country club&#10;(You're born in December, I'm born in June)&#10;Yeah (Under the chemtrails, over the country club)&#10;You're born in December, I'm born in June&#10;Yeah, my Cancer is sun, and my Leo is moon&#10;My Cancer is sun and my Leo is moon&#10;Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah&#10;Yeah, yeah, yeah&#10;&#10;Lyric video for &#34;Chemtrails Over The Country Club&#34; by Lana Del Rey"
