    title "Lana Del Rey - Chemtrails Over The Country Club FULL ALBUM REACTION!"
    description "Lana Del Rey - Chemtrails Over The Country Club FULL ALBUM REACTION! Reacting to the 6th studio album from Lana Del Rey. What a pleasure and a privilege to be able to listen to a new Lana album at the same time as all her amazing fans. And what an album it is! &#10;&#10;WATCH THIS REACTION UNCUT AT:&#10;https://www.patreon.com/jondenton&#10;&#10;Watched the reaction? Check out my FINAL THOUGHTS&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ouxrtiK7R7I&#38;t=1s&#10;&#10;Favourite Songs:&#10;White Dress&#10;Wild At Heart&#10;Dark But Just A Game&#10;&#10;&#10;Watch &#128250;&#10;MY MOST ANTICIPATED ALBUMS OF 2021 &#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TbaUJu9MHNI&#10;&#10;THE WEEKND - HOUSE OF BALLOONS Full Album REACTION!&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xGSvg6i2_EM&#38;t=1s&#10;&#10;TRAVIS SCOTT - RODEO Full Album REACTION!&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mODYdhVtgv8&#10;YouTube's copyright &#10;&#10;Follow me &#11015;&#10;https://www.twitter.com/jondenton&#10;https://www.instagram.com/jondenton22&#10;https://www.twitch.tv/jondenton&#10;&#10;LIVE ALBUM REACTIONS AND LISTENING PARTIES ON TWITCH!&#10;https://www.twitch.tv/jondenton&#10;&#10;Contact jondenton22@gmail.com for promo&#10;&#10;Beats by Luca Malaspina - check him out for FIRE beats&#10;&#10;Luca Malaspina Beats&#10;https://www.youtube.com/lucamalaspinabeats&#10;https://instagram.com/lucamalaspinabeats&#10;&#10;     &#10;New to the channel? Subscribe!&#10;https://goo.gl/AnKLMC"
