    step 0
    date "2021-03-19T23:15:21Z"
    title "Lana Del Rey - Chemtrails Over The Country Club | Album Review"
    description "&#9658;Donate on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/ARTV&#10;&#9658;Twitch Streams: https://www.twitch.tv/artvgames&#10;&#9658;Follow my social media: https://linktr.ee/artvjon&#10;&#9658;My Spotify: http://bit.ly/ARTVSpotify&#10;&#10;My review of the latest album &#34;Chemtrails Over The Country Club&#34; by the controversial singer-songwriter Lana Del Rey. I&#8217;ve struggled to enjoy Lana&#8217;s music since she debuted over a decade ago, yet her 2019 effort NFR gave me hope for her artistic ability. What did she deliver this time around? &#10;&#10;&#34;Chemtrails Over The Country Club&#34;&#10;Polydor/Interscope Records&#10;Release: 3/19/21&#10;Rating: 2/5&#10;&#10;&#9658;Favorite tracks: Dark But Just A Game, Breaking Up Slowly, Yosemite&#10;&#10;&#9658;Least faves: White Dress, Not All Those Who Wander Are Lost, Wild At Heart, Let Me Love You Like A Woman, Tulsa Jesus Freak&#10;&#10;&#9658;Killer thumbnail designs by Infinity on Hannah: http://bit.ly/InfinityOnHannah&#10;&#10;&#9658;Opening riff &#34;Swimming Pools&#34; covered by Rob Scallon: https://youtu.be/Wm-H2d_5FSg&#10;&#10;Special thank you to my $75 a month Patrons: Dayton Hamilton, Brandon Barenfeld, and Sombre Artist &#10;&#10;&#9658;Every review I've ever done: http://bit.ly/ARTVarchive&#10;&#10;&#9658;Try it out: https://open.spotify.com/album/6QeosPQpJckkW0Obir5RT8?si=64WiXklCTBiEPCkRwXOjFQ&#10;&#10;#LanaDelRey #ChemtrailsOverTheCountryClub #Review&#10;&#10;Lana Del Rey - Chemtrails Over The Country Club - Album Tracklist&#10;&#10;1. &#34;White Dress&#34;&#10;2. &#34;Chemtrails Over the Country Club&#34;&#10;3. &#34;Tulsa Jesus Freak&#34;&#10;4. &#34;Let Me Love You Like a Woman&#34;&#10;5. &#34;Wild at Heart&#34;&#10;6. &#34;Dark But Just a Game&#34;&#10;7. &#34;Not All Who Wander Are Lost&#34;&#10;8. &#34;Yosemite&#34;&#10;9. &#34;Breaking Up Slowly&#34; (ft. Nikki Lane)&#10;10. &#34;Dance Till We Die&#34;&#10;11. &#34;For Free&#34; (ft. Weyes Blood &#38; Zella Day)"
