    title "Somewhere Over the Chemtrails (Kdyby radelo) | Clip | Berlinale 2022"
    description "A clip from &#34;Somewhere Over the Chemtrails&#34; (Kdyby rad&#353;i ho&#345;elo) by Adam Koloman Rybansk&#253;, starring Miroslav Krobot, Michal Isten&#237;k, Anna Pol&#237;vkov&#225;, Vladim&#237;r &#352;kult&#233;ty and Albert &#268;uba.&#10;&#10;About the film: When a villager is injured by a car at a party, firefighter Bronya is immediately convinced that it is an attack perpetrated by an &#34;Arab&#34;. His colleague Standa sees things differently. A laconic film that explores the causes of racism.&#10;&#10;Part of the Panorama programme 2022.&#10;&#10;Have you seen the film? Let the Berlinale community know what you think in the comments below.&#10;&#10;SUBSCRIBE TO OUR BERLINALE CHANNEL HERE&#10;&#9658; https://bit.ly/BerlinaleYouTube&#8203;&#8203;&#10;&#10;CHECK OUT&#10;&#9658; Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/berlinale/&#10;&#9658; Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/berlinale&#10;&#9658; Twitter: https://twitter.com/berlinale&#10;&#9658; LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/company/berlinale&#10;&#9658; Website: https://www.berlinale.de&#8203;&#8203;&#10;&#9658; Newsletter: https://bit.ly/BerlinaleNewsletter&#8203;&#10;&#10;#Berlinale #Berlinale2022 #BerlinalePanorama #KdybyRad&#353;iHo&#345;elo #SomewhereOverTheChemtrails #AdamKolomanRybansk&#10;&#10;Thumbnail: &#169; Bratri"
