    description "The video is playing too fast? Change the speed! (follow the following instruction)&#10;https://youtu.be/TuQyIK4BUWM&#10;&#10;Learn to read violin fingerings (E1, A0, G2 etc.)&#10;https://youtu.be/A1dEXcaG0QA?t=169&#10;&#10;Download the TVB FIngerboard in the following link:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NmeXna4vbA8&#10;&#10;Start with [Level 1] pieces and challenge yourself with [Level 5]!&#10;=================================================&#10;About The Violin Beginner&#10;&#10;The purpose of this channel: &#10;- Allow violin beginners to learn and play various new songs easily&#10;- Provide more joy to violin beginners&#10;&#10;Our work:&#10;- Regularly upload new trending songs/music&#10;- Simplify the music to a suitable level for beginners (The key of the music may be changed from the original)&#10;- Provide an easy way to learn the music&#10;- Provide background accompaniments to play along&#10;&#10;We simplify all the music to (basically) 4 colors and 4 numbers. After understanding the concept, you can play almost whatever simple music that exists. &#10;&#10;4 Colour, 4 Numbers, play WHATEVER!&#10;&#10;Follow us on twitter: https://twitter.com/theviolinbegin1&#10;=================================================&#10;The Video Content has been made available for informational and educational purposes only"
    channeltitle "The Violin Beginner"
