    date "2021-12-05T14:00:18Z"
    title "Are Chemtrails ACTUALLY Dangerous?"
    description "Today we are talking about Chemtrails. It&#8217;s the theory that governments or other parties are part of a secret plan to add toxic chemicals to the atmosphere from aircrafts in a way that forms visible trails in the sky. So, basically they are saying that all those planes in the sky leaving these trails of white puffs are intentionally poisoning the population.&#10;&#10;0:00 - Chemtrail introduction&#10;1:22 - Albedo Modification&#10;2:21 - Contrails&#10;3:33 - NASA Clouds with Jeremy Clarkson&#10;4:52 - Navy Chemtrails?&#10;5:32 - The Research Letters&#10;&#10;&#9749;&#65039;  Buy me a Coffee! &#10;https://ko-fi.com/wtwshow&#10;&#10;&#128241;&#127909; &#10;Shot with iPhone 12 Pro Max. Dolby Vision is still not compatible with Adobe Premiere Pro. HDR turned off and shot in 30fps (usually 24fps)&#10;&#128241;&#127909; &#10;&#10;[Episode was written by Jonathan Maxwell]&#10;This is a weekly show with new episodes coming every Sunday.&#10;________________________________________________________________&#10;Click the subscribe button now so you don't miss out on our weekly videos.  &#10;________________________________________________________________&#10;&#10;What the What Show information:&#10;Website: https://www.wtwshow.com/&#10;&#10;Instagram: @what_the_what_show&#10;https://bit.ly/whattheinstagram&#10;&#10;&#10;Interested in writing or have ideas?&#10;Email: theWhatTheWhatShow@gmail.com&#10;&#10;&#10;#chemtrails #contrails #conspiracytheories"
    channeltitle "What the What Show"
