  node [
    id 157
    label "mtgkkAZDXIo"
    step 0
    date "2016-10-09T20:41:15Z"
    title "CHEMTRAILS DEBUNKED - Bullshit Busted #4"
    description "Ever since the mid-90s, there's been a movement of conspiracy theorists who believe the long trails behind jet aircraft are toxic chemicals being sprayed into the air. They refer to these trails as &#34;chemtrails&#34;. This video debunks some of the common arguments used to support the chemtrail conspiracy theory.&#10;&#10;Subscribe: https://www.youtube.com/user/natetalkstoyou?sub_confirmation=1&#10;&#10;Email: natetalkstoyou@ymail.com&#10;2nd Channel: http://youtube.com/NateTalks2You&#10;Facebook: http://www.facebook.com/NateTalksToYou&#10;Twitter: http://twitter.com/NateTalksToYou&#10;deviantART: http://nathanmd.deviantart.com/&#10;&#10;SOURCES:&#10;&#10;Meteorology: Understanding the Atmosphere&#10;https://books.google.com/books?id=qWcrAQAAQBAJ&#10;&#10;Aircraft Contrails Factsheet&#10;https://www.faa.gov/regulations_policies/policy_guidance/envir_policy/media/contrails.pdf&#10;&#10;Condensation trails&#10;http://www.airservicesaustralia.com/aircraftnoise/aircraft-operations/9518-2/&#10;&#10;Understanding Contrails: &#10;A window into conditions in the upper troposphere&#10;http://science-edu.larc.nasa.gov/contrail-edu/pdf/science/CFG_slides.pdf&#10;&#10;Contrails 101&#10;https://www.faa.gov/about/office_org/headquarters_offices/apl/noise_emissions/contrails/&#10;&#10;Exploring the Sky by Day&#10;https://books.google.com/books?id=Y3CNKwAACAAJ&#10;&#10;A Field Guide to the Atmosphere&#10;https://books.google.com/books?id=q0QI19T_POkC&#10;&#10;International Cloud Atlas &#10;http://library.wmo.int/pmb_ged/wmo_407_en-v1.pdf&#10;&#10;Multiple Contrail Streamers Observed by Radar&#10;http://journals.ametsoc.org/doi/pdf/10.1175/1520-0450(1974)013%3C0563%3AMCSOBR%3E2.0.CO%3B2&#10;&#10;Clouds of the World&#10;https://books.google.com/books?id=B5cRAQAAIAAJ&#10;&#10;Airborne Observations of Contrail Effects on the Thermal Radiation Budget &#10;http://journals.ametsoc.org/doi/pdf/10.1175/1520-0469(1970)027%3C0937%3AAOOCEO%3E2.0.CO%3B2&#10;&#10;A Colour Guide to Clouds&#10;https://books.google.com/books?id=1TXgBAAAQBAJ&#10;&#10;Cloud Study: A Pictorial Guide&#10;https://books.google.com/books?id=iZYJAQAAIAAJ&#10;&#10;Condensation Trails&#10;http://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/j.1477-8696.1946.tb00024.x/abstract&#10;&#10;Clouds and Weather Phenomena&#10;https://books.google.com/books?id=iVMQCAAAQBAJ&#10;&#10;Mission To Bremen&#10;archive.org/details/CS-1062&#10;&#10;The Memphis Belle: A Story Of A Flying Fortress&#10;archive.org/details/TheMemphisBelleAStoryofaFlyingFortress&#10;&#10;The Enemy Strikes, 1945&#10;https://youtu.be/Fu1AIiqARiQ&#10;&#10;Meopham Issue Title - Looking Around&#10;https://youtu.be/yi70fLyaXYQ&#10;&#10;ICAO Seminar on International Air Transport Policy and Liberalization&#10;http://www.icao.int/Meetings/ICAN2013/Documents/Presentations/ican_2013_ICAO_ATConf-6.pdf&#10;&#10;United Airlines Timetables, Route Maps and History.&#10;http://airchive.com/html/timetable-and-route-maps/united-airlines-timetables-route-maps-and-history&#10;&#10;What is a contrail and how does it form?&#10;http://www.wrh.noaa.gov/fgz/science/contrail.php&#10;&#10;Flight Lines - Why contrails hang around.&#10;http://www.airspacemag.com/flight-today/flight-lines-3-18415244/&#10;&#10;Encyclopedia of Atmospheric Sciences&#10;https://books.google.com/books?id=8lpzAwAAQBAJ&#10;&#10;Contrails - Persistent&#10;http://science-edu.larc.nasa.gov/contrail-edu/contrails-persistent.php&#10;&#10;Contrails and Clouds&#10;http://science-edu.larc.nasa.gov/contrail-edu/contrails-and-clouds.php&#10;&#10;Boeing Wideboadies&#10;https://books.google.com/books?id=OEniu9ff-_sC&#10;&#10;Tour an Airbus A380&#10;http://www.seattlepi.com/news/slideshow/Tour-an-Airbus-A380-3281/photo-646552.php&#10;&#10;Take a Peek Inside the 747-8 Test Plane&#10;http://www.wired.com/2010/02/peek-inside-boeing-747-8/&#10;&#10;Inside Boeing : Building the 777&#10;https://books.google.com/books?id=iJ2FqbrRqyYC&#10;&#10;Onboard the first Boeing 787 Dreamliner&#10;https://youtu.be/uHAf7HzMG8g&#10;&#10;Aerial delivery system &#10;https://www.google.com/patents/US7413145&#10;&#10;747 Supertanker&#8217;s world tour&#10;http://wildfiretoday.com/2009/07/30/747-supertankers-world-tour/&#10;&#10;Global Supertanker &#8211; Air Tanker Board &#10;https://vimeo.com/179143108&#10;&#10;EU_GSTS &#10;https://vimeo.com/158012582&#10;&#10;Fuel Dumping&#10;http://www.zurich-airport.com/~/media/flughafenzh/dokumente/das_unternehmen/laerm_politik_und_umwelt/2012_fuel_dumping_en.pdf&#10;&#10;Aircraft Fuel System&#10;https://www.faa.gov/regulations_policies/handbooks_manuals/aircraft/amt_airframe_handbook/media/ama_ch14.pdf&#10;&#10;Ask the Pilot&#10;https://books.google.com/books?id=xqqGGLFa4Z8C&#10;&#10;Flying the Airbus A380&#10;https://books.google.com/books?id=j_08BAAAQBAJ&#10;&#10;Why do planes have to dump fuel for emergency landings?&#10;http://usatoday30.usatoday.com/travel/columnist/getline/2005-01-10-ask-the-captain_x.htm&#10;&#10;#NateTalksToYou #NTTY"
