    description "Lana del Rey Chemtrails Over The Country Club Ranked WORST to BEST / TOPS PRODUCCIONES&#10;&#10;After the acclaimed NFR!, there was a lot of anticipation for Lana's next album, and after almost two years of waiting, Chemtrails Over The Country Club arrived, was it worth the wait? Find out in our ranking&#127818;&#10;What is your favorite song? &#129300;&#10;Comment your opinion and enjoy the video!! &#128150;&#10;&#10;Despu&#233;s del aclamado NFR!, hab&#237;a mucha expectativa sobre el siguiente album de Lana, y luego de casi dos a&#241;os de espera, lleg&#243; Chemtrails Over The Country Club, vali&#243; la pena la espera? Desc&#250;brelo en nuestro ranking&#127818;&#10;Cual es tu canci&#243;n favorita? &#129300;&#10;Comenta tu opini&#243;n y disfruta el video!! &#128150;&#10;&#10;#LanaDelRey #WhiteDress #ChemtrailsOverTheCountryClub"
