    title "Chemtrails The facts"
    description "The chemtrail conspiracy holds that some contrails are actually chemicals or biological agents deliberately sprayed at high altitudes for a purpose undisclosed to the general public.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;In this presentation we will try to give 4 possible explanations for this phenomena.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;some of the videos that are used in this clip are from the following YouTube channels:&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;British Chemtrails Documentary: http://www.youtube.com/user/PoeticalTv&#13;&#10;chemtrail chaff (v2): http://www.youtube.com/user/grandmacaesar&#13;&#10;Chemtrails-NWO-Illuminati: http://www.youtube.com/user/TheAscendedConscious&#13;&#10;Chemtrails weatherman: http://www.youtube.com/user/Jpom22&#13;&#10;CONTRAIL vs CHEMTRAIL 101: http://www.youtube.com/user/truthseeker1922&#13;&#10;NASA Appleman Chart - PROOF of Chemtrails: http://www.youtube.com/user/TrutherD1&#13;&#10;History Channel_ The Truth About Chemtrails And HAARP Technology: http://www.youtube.com/user/2012isnear&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;http://www.emetaheret.org.il"
