  node [
    id 303
    label "6gFbvzGg6aw"
    step 0
    date "2020-05-04T07:00:05Z"
    title "TMN | AGENDA 21 - S.A.I. Are Chemtrails"
    description "Copyright Disclaimer. Under Section 107 of the Copyright Act 1976, allowance is made for &#34;fair use&#34; for purposes such as criticism, comment, news reporting, teaching, scholarship, and research. Fair use is a use permitted by copyright statute that might otherwise be infringing. Non-profit, educational or personal use tips the balance in favor of fair use.&#10;&#10;TMN s3e12 | AGENDA 21 - S.A.I. Are Chemtrails&#10;&#10;Los Angeles/Orange County | December 17, 2019 | 1222&#10;&#10;(Not a Contrail, ignore the misinformation above from Encyclopedia Britannica or Wikipedia)&#10;&#10;-Musical Credits-&#10;&#34;Haunted&#34; and &#34;The Wasteland&#34; by Ross Bugden &#10;https://soundcloud.com/rossbugden &#10;Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0) https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/&#10;&#10;Screen Credit @ 8:50 &#10;&#10;Have you seen cloudy trails high in the sky and just thinking they were natural or simply planes flying overhead that leave trails behind?  These trails are &#34;weather modification/geo-engineering programs&#34; widely known as &#34;chemtrails&#34; or S.A.I.  Planes at high altitudes are spraying toxic chemicals such as barium, aluminum, cadmium, and strontium-90 that later fall to the ground, ending up in our bodies by water, soil and the air.  Please do you own research on this topic, be well informed and watch the skies.&#10;&#10;&#34;...One that has gained my personal attention is stratospheric aerosol injection, or SAI, a method of seeding the stratosphere with particles that can help reflect the sun&#8217;s heat, in much the same way that volcanic eruptions do.&#10;&#10;An SAI program could limit global temperature increases, reducing some risks associated with higher temperatures and providing the world economy additional time to transition from fossil fuels. The process is also relatively inexpensive&#8212;the National Research Council estimates that a fully deployed SAI program would cost about $10 billion yearly. &#10;&#10;As promising as it may be, moving forward on SAI would raise a number of challenges for our government and for the international community. On the technical side, greenhouse gas emission reductions would still have to accompany SAI to address other climate change effects, such as ocean acidification, because SAI alone would not remove greenhouse gases from the atmosphere.&#10;On the geopolitical side, the technology&#8217;s potential to alter weather patterns and benefit certain regions at the expense of others could trigger sharp opposition by some nations. &#10;&#10;Others might seize on SAI&#8217;s benefits and back away from their commitment to carbon dioxide reductions. And, as with other breakthrough technologies, global norms and standards are lacking to guide the deployment and implementation of SAI.&#10;&#10;I could go on, and on, and on...&#34; &#10;&#10;CIA Director John Brennan &#10;&#10;-References-&#10;&#10;CSPAN2 (October 29, 2013)&#10;Coverage on &#34;Climate Engineering&#34; &#10;https://www.c-span.org/video/?316632-1/debate-climate-engineering&#10;&#10;CSPAN (June 29, 2016)&#10;Coverage on Global Threats by CIA Director John Brennan&#10;https://www.c-span.org/video/?411936-1/cia-director-john-brennan-discusses-global-threats&#10;&#10;CIA Transcript (June 29, 2016)&#10;Director Brennan Speaks at the Council on Foreign Relations &#10;https://www.cia.gov/news-information/speeches-testimony/2016-speeches-testimony/director-brennan-speaks-at-the-council-on-foreign-relations.html&#10;&#10;KUSA 9News Colorado. &#34;Verify: Is there a secret chemtrail spraying program?&#34;  (February 22, 2018)&#10;https://www.wusa9.com/article/news/local/investigations/verify-is-there-a-secret-chemtrail-spraying-program/73-522279970&#10;&#10;National Science Foundation &#34;Weather and Climate Modification&#34; (December 20, 1965)&#10;https://www.nsf.gov/nsb/publications/1965/nsb1265.pdf&#10;&#10;ClimateViewer News &#34;Geoengineering and Weather Modification Exposed&#34; (January 3, 2013)&#10;https://climateviewer.com/geoengineering/&#10;&#10;MIT Technology Review &#34;What is geoengineering&#8212;and why should you care?&#34; (August 9, 2019)&#10;https://www.technologyreview.com/2019/08/09/615/what-is-geoengineering-and-why-should-you-care-climate-change-harvard/&#10;&#10;Nuclear Weather Forecast &#34;Weaponizing Weather &#38; Earthquakes, Geoengineering&#34; https://www.nuclearweatherforecast.com/geo-engineering---emp---haarp---cern--chem-trails.html&#10;&#10;Pennsylvania General Assembly &#34; WEATHERMODIFICATION- REGULATINGRAINMAKING&#34; (January 19, 1968)&#10; (https://www.legis.state.pa.us/WU01/LI/LI/US/PDF/1967/0/0449..PDF&#10;&#10;CNBC &#34;Why Bill Gates Is Funding Solar Geoengineering Research&#34; (September 7, 2019)&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WR6uSXW-8p4&#10;&#10;ABC &#34;Jet plane dumps fuel over elementary school yard&#34; (January 15, 2020)&#10;https://abcnews.go.com/GMA/News/video/jet-plane-dumps-fuel-elementary-school-yard-68295097&#10;&#10;KCAL &#34;There's No Such Rush: Aviation Expert Questions Why Pilot Did Not Dump Fuel Over Ocean&#34; (January 14, 2020)&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1L2-lIP5bSU&#10;&#10;CBS &#34;Controversial spraying method aims to curb global warming&#34; (November 23, 2018)&#10;https://www.cbsnews.com/news/geoengineering-treatment-stratospheric-aerosol-injection-climate-change-study-today-2018-11-23/"
