    date "2013-09-24T19:55:44Z"
    title "How contrails (not chemtrails) form grid (checkerboard) patterns"
    description "When you see a checkerboard pattern of contrails in the sky, it is not because &#34;chemtrails&#34; are sprayed in a grid pattern to cover an area. The actual reason is that contrails are continually driven by the winds so planes flying exactly along the same path result in a series of parallel contrails. Video inspired by a similar simulation at http://contrailscience.com/contrail-simulations/"
